ts from both `features_cache1` and `features_cache2` here)\r\n└── models/\r\n    ├── finetuned/\r\n    │   └── (copy the extracted `models` folder from `finetuned.zip`)\r\n    └── svm/\r\n        └── (copy the extracted `models` folder from `svm.zip`)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Instructions\r\n\r\n1. Extract `features_cache1.zip` and `features_cache2.zip`.\r\n2. Copy the contents of the extracted `models` folders into `features_cache/`.\r\n3. Extract `finetuned.zip` and copy the extracted `models` folder into `models/finetuned/`.\r\n4. Extract `svm.zip` and copy the extracted `models` folder into `models/svm/`.\r\n\r\n> **Note:** Copy only the contents of the extracted `models` folders. Do not create additional nested `models` directories.\r\n"}]